{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-09_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-09","title":"裏工作","storyCode":"2-9","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"b6a30c1894a021f0c40ddbea525b561500fa7597d0935e77ebbb02964e8a624f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十一关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"これで……最後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"がはっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"敵追撃部隊、制圧完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"周囲に敵影なし！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ところで、指揮を執ってた幹部は？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"この部隊にはいなかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"となると、どこかに潜伏して様子見しつつ、あとをつけてきてるってとこかしら。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"大方、あたしたちの体力切れを待って、確実に仕留められるタイミングで襲撃するつもりでしょうね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい。恐らく、そうだと思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"チェルノボーグでの経験からして、レユニオンは奇襲作戦を得意としているようですし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ここはひとまず、撤退しましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが、現状の撤退ルートでは、安全とは言い切れません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"交差点を塞ぐ形でビルを破壊されでもしたら、危険に晒されることは明白ですから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"では、すぐにほかのルートを探しましょう。できるだけ目立たない道が理想です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤさん、四時方向のはしごから降りるのはどうでしょう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"んー、ちょっと無理があると思うけど？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"はああっ！　ロドスめ、覚悟しろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　伏兵です、気をつけて！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"行け、続けて追撃しろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"息つく暇を与えるな！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……あの、隊長さん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"――スラムの中には……子供の感染者もいるんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"できることなら、どうか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子たちを、守ってあげてくれませんか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……龍門の治安を守ることは、もとより近衛局の責務だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者は、龍門の市民ではないが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――紛れもなく、龍門の一部ではある。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ゆえに、私は私の為すべきことを為そう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"キミの頼みには、何を保障することもできんがな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"結局のところ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"――でも、あの子たちから聞いたんです。前にも、あなたが……"},{"type":"narration","text":"="},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――我々は常に、そうした責務に努めてきたし、今後もそう在り続ける。それだけの話だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……ありがとう、ございます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ときに、我々がキミを探していた理由については理解しているか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"いえ……はっきりとはわかりません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"私には、あなたたちに必要とされるような心当たりはないですし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"だけど、もしかしたら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"その理由は、私自身じゃなくて――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"――お父さんにあるんじゃないか、って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……その通りだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"キミのお父上は、チェルノボーグの高名な科学者だったと聞いた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"それと同時に、かの都市における政治的な重要人物の一人だった、ともな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ゆえに、キミは何かを知りえている可能性がある。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――とはいえ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"あくまで可能性の話だが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、キミがレユニオンの手に落ちるような事態は避けねばならない、というのが我々の見解だ。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"アハッ、み～つけた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"ごめんなさいねぇ？　近衛局に恨みはないんだけど――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"今回はと～っても面白い筋書きを用意しちゃったの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"これをもっと素敵な喜劇にするために……あんたたちにも、舞台へ上がってもらわないとね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"それじゃあ……早速、始めましょうか。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["ミーシャ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["スカルシュレッダー"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
